# Dedicated build mode for the REMOTE dev app (no Entra login gate). JAA-656.
#
# Built via `npm run build:dev-noauth` (= vite build --mode dev-noauth). Because
# --mode dev-noauth makes vite load THIS file instead of .env.production, the
# VITE_AUTH_BYPASS flag is baked into import.meta.env at build time: authBypassed()
# returns true, so loadAuthProvider() resolves DevAuthProvider and NO login gate
# shows. Note we deliberately DO NOT set VITE_AUTH_PROVIDER here — the bypass wins
# regardless, but leaving it unset keeps intent obvious.
#
# Same-origin (the dev backend serves the SPA + /api/v1 from one host).
VITE_BASE_PATH=/
VITE_BRIDGE_API_URL=/api/v1
VITE_AUTH_BYPASS=true
